":11711,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:27.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-08 10:04:51","images":[{"id":333144,"filename":"cf04c490-178a-4ba5-b35b-44912714bb6e.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":145145,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:52.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:52.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/cf04c490-178a-4ba5-b35b-44912714bb6e.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":424484,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":145145,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 3"}]},{"id":145138,"number":4,"name":"Episodio 4","plot":"After a shock expulsion, the county fair arrives in town. Who’s going to get friendly on the Ferris wheel? The students find out it’s time for Summer Camp, but not all of them will go as THREE newbies will choose who gets to go. Will any of the students be tempted to stray? And just when they think they can relax with a s’more, the Principal has some devastating news for them.","duration":48,"scws_id":416366,"season_id":11711,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:01:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:27.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-08 10:01:06","images":[{"id":333120,"filename":"aa165e5f-152e-4962-aac1-59f7d20f3f94.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":145138,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:01:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T08:01:06.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/aa165e5f-152e-4962-aac1-59f7d20f3f94.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":424465,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":145138,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 4"}]},{"id":145146,"number":5,"name":"Episodio 5","plot":"The Camp Crush students return minus the latest student to be expelled. Yasmine has the convo she’s been dreading with Max. In sex ed class, things get very hot and steamy. Jess and Kyle enjoy a flirty first date in the diner. At Valentine’s dance, Sin and Max face a big dilemma, and when Dan confronts his date, all hell breaks loose.","duration":49,"scws_id":416367,"season_id":11711,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:54.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:27.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-08 10:04:54","images":[{"id":333145,"filename":"1c210704-176d-4c79-ab5e-08020bd0649a.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":145146,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T08:04:55.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/1c210704-176d-4c79-ab5e-08020bd0649a.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":424485,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":145146,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 5"}]},{"id":145143,"number":6,"name":"Episodio 6","plot":"It’s the morning after the Valentine’s dance drama massacre. Some students are headed to detention, but who exactly is in the bad books? Geoff’s seen another side to Chante and wants a chat. Could this spell the end? The school Talent Show takes place – with some showing more natural flair than others - but winning first place isn’t quite the fabulous prize the students were hoping for.","duration":47,"scws_id":416368,"season_id":11711,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:03:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:27.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-08 10:03:29","images":[{"id":333134,"filename":"cb4deab1-0500-4fb7-97ae-ee45341b07a5.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":145143,"created_at":"2025-10-08T08:03:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T08:03:29.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/cb4deab1-0500-4fb7-97ae-ee45341b07a5.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":424476,"translatable